You make it possible
Our growth requires robust, safe and always available services. As a Tech Lead, you can see where risk derivatives arise: complexity is emerging, scalability is at risk and technical debt requires leadership. You send in before customers notice. With modern cloud technology, sustainable solutions and high code quality, you and the team make the difference, not just today, but for the future.
You look further ahead than the next release and you dare challenge yourself and the team. In addition, you coach the developers of the team technically and take your initiative to further our products. You are the leader of the group, and switch easily with our product owners, engineering manager and other development teams.
Specifically, this means that you:
+ Leadership takes over the low-code platform development team;
+ Together with this team we develop our low-code platform, based on wishes from the operation and technical requirements for future-proofing;
+ When senior increases code quality through coaching, code reviews and knowledge sharing;
+ Actively builds on architectural choices, coding standards and automation in roll-out;
+ Quality guarantees through tests, monitoring and good documentation;
+ Continuously looking for improvements in scalability, stability, performance, security;
+ Together with colleagues such as developers, product owners and engineering managers spart on solutions;
+ When necessary our fellow consultants of consultancy and support helps to solve complex problems with our low-code platform;
+ Responsibility takes place for a number of existing custom projects and, if necessary, does not decline for a new customized assignment.
