On Monday, you save with the team members and make sure that everyone knows what they need to work on, and that they can continue with that. You pick up a change yourself that requires a new scalable service and you're immediately thinking about architecture and security impact. Later in the week, you will review the code of colleagues and help a mid-term with a complex async-workflow. You consult with our product owners and engineering manager and ensure that the team is aligned and know what is going on. In between you will explore new technical possibilities and make improvements that allow customers to work even more finely with our software. You work hybridly and thus find the ideal balance between focus and collaboration.
